(4160, 160, 103, 'Family history of depression.  Currently dealing with depression and anxiety, as well as drug addition.

Employer provides & pays premiums on insurance which covers therapy and prescriptions.  Employer allows work-from-home and unlimited PTO which makes episodes easier to control.

I don''t speak of my problems to anyone at work except for the people that I consider friends, and even then I don''t go into great detail.

I would never bring up a mental health issue during an interview for fear of discrimination and rejection (and therefore greater depression).  

One co-worker had serious anxiety problems and would not inform his team of episodes and was eventually let go for being unresponsive.', 'Family history of depression.  Currently dealing with depression and anxiety, as well as drug addition.

Employer provides & pays premiums on insurance which covers therapy and prescriptions.  Employer allows work-from-home and unlimited PTO which makes episodes easier to control.

I don''t speak of my problems to anyone at work except for the people that I consider friends, and even then I don''t go into great detail.

I would never bring up a mental health issue during an interview for fear of discrimination and rejection (and therefore greater depression).  

One co-worker had serious anxiety problems and would not inform his team of episodes and was eventually let go for being unresponsive.'),
