(11310, 435, 103, 'I talked to a psychiatrist once about taking medical leave for mental health issues, with his referral. He was willing to help but warned me that I may not want to, as he''s seen that sort of thing follow people throughout their tech careers (word gets out, even if it''s "confidential" at work). I''ve been terrified of bringing mental health up anywhere that coworkers or potential employers could see ever since.', 'I talked to a psychiatrist once about taking medical leave for mental health issues, with his referral. He was willing to help but warned me that I may not want to, as he''s seen that sort of thing follow people throughout their tech careers (word gets out, even if it''s "confidential" at work). I''ve been terrified of bringing mental health up anywhere that coworkers or potential employers could see ever since.'),
