(15652, 602, 103, 'The supposed divide between mental and physical health needs to done away with and probably will be as our knowledge of the brain increases. That said, we are often employed for our ability to provide value. If any issue prevents is from providing value, that creates a very real challenge for the employer who is responsible to shareholders and other team members who are providing value. There are no easy answers here.', 'The supposed divide between mental and physical health needs to done away with and probably will be as our knowledge of the brain increases. That said, we are often employed for our ability to provide value. If any issue prevents is from providing value, that creates a very real challenge for the employer who is responsible to shareholders and other team members who are providing value. There are no easy answers here.'),
