However, now I am curious if my employees know just how supportive the company would be of their mental health needs, and this survey is making me realize that we probably haven''t done a great job communicating that to everyone.  Thanks for doing this.', 'Since I am the CEO of my startup, some of the "would you feel comfortable" and "do you know the policy" questions are interesting.  Of course I feel comfortable, since no one can fire me, and I know the policies because I chose them!

However, now I am curious if my employees know just how supportive the company would be of their mental health needs, and this survey is making me realize that we probably haven''t done a great job communicating that to everyone.  Thanks for doing this.'),
