(19682, 757, 103, 'I work for the state, so the health plan is large and cumbersome.  I believe it covers most medical as a state benefit, but I haven''t seen any promotion of it.  And it''s not really the same as a tech company where I am.  We are an IT department, but hardly run like any tech company around.', 'I work for the state, so the health plan is large and cumbersome.  I believe it covers most medical as a state benefit, but I haven''t seen any promotion of it.  And it''s not really the same as a tech company where I am.  We are an IT department, but hardly run like any tech company around.'),
