(20644, 794, 103, 'I work for the state government. While things are slowly changing regarding covering mental health with state employees, it''s just not something that is acceptable in this kind of strict environment, so I have to be careful about what I say and how I say it. I often take mental health days, but have to call in with a physical illness because mental health problems are not acceptable excuses for using sick leave.', 'I work for the state government. While things are slowly changing regarding covering mental health with state employees, it''s just not something that is acceptable in this kind of strict environment, so I have to be careful about what I say and how I say it. I often take mental health days, but have to call in with a physical illness because mental health problems are not acceptable excuses for using sick leave.'),
