(31798, 1223, 103, 'The data will be skewed for self-employed people as the questions contain some bias.

Having said that: being self-employed I *choose* to work for companies which want to employ *me*, not just my skills, but including my opinions, my life-experience etc. If a potential contract/job doesn''t *feel* right, I prefer to not take it (and be poor), than to compromise myself.', 'The data will be skewed for self-employed people as the questions contain some bias.

Having said that: being self-employed I *choose* to work for companies which want to employ *me*, not just my skills, but including my opinions, my life-experience etc. If a potential contract/job doesn''t *feel* right, I prefer to not take it (and be poor), than to compromise myself.'),
