(122792, 2717, 59, 'On my second day of work, I had a breakdown and was unable to enter the building. My employer met me outside  and listened to my problems. Following our conversation he offered to let me work from home, which I did until a few weeks later when I was comfortable to come into the office.', 'On my second day of work, I had a breakdown and was unable to enter the building. My employer met me outside  and listened to my problems. Following our conversation he offered to let me work from home, which I did until a few weeks later when I was comfortable to come into the office.'),
