(123782, 2730, 61, 'I''ve had multiple conversations with groups of coworkers that include people dealing with anxiety and depression themselves. Anyone I worked with directly and talked about this has been very supportive and empathetic.', 'I''ve had multiple conversations with groups of coworkers that include people dealing with anxiety and depression themselves. Anyone I worked with directly and talked about this has been very supportive and empathetic.'),
