(123793, 2730, 72, '1', '1'),
(123794, 2730, 73, 'I was having a very hard time managing my anxiety and was hyperventilating and crying in the bathroom periodically. The coworkers I told about it were very supportive and helped me get the help I needed. That group of coworkers was a little older and were a great help with the administrative burden of working with an insurance company to pay for treatment.', 'I was having a very hard time managing my anxiety and was hyperventilating and crying in the bathroom periodically. The coworkers I told about it were very supportive and helped me get the help I needed. That group of coworkers was a little older and were a great help with the administrative burden of working with an insurance company to pay for treatment.'),
