(124856, 2744, 71, 'At my previous place of employment I had a mental illness that manifested itself physically and was very obvious to anyone who saw me. One of my supervisors brought up that he had a family member who suffered from the same way, and he seemed pretty understanding and was easy to talk to', 'At my previous place of employment I had a mental illness that manifested itself physically and was very obvious to anyone who saw me. One of my supervisors brought up that he had a family member who suffered from the same way, and he seemed pretty understanding and was easy to talk to'),
(124857, 2744, 72, '1', '1'),
(124858, 2744, 73, 'As mentioned previously, one of my illnesses is obvious when it''s not maintained. My coworkers at my last job were friends and were concerned so would ask me about it and offer support.', 'As mentioned previously, one of my illnesses is obvious when it''s not maintained. My coworkers at my last job were friends and were concerned so would ask me about it and offer support.'),
