(126617, 2767, 84, '-1', NULL),
(126618, 2767, 85, '2', '2'),
(126619, 2767, 86, 'Destigmatize it so that people don''t feel like they are othered, and so that no one acts like "no one here has mental illness/is disabled/etc".  Find plans that don''t place limits on how many times you can see a professional or what you can see a professional for (ex. autism diagnosis is covered but no follow-up therapy related to it is).  Enable spaces where (safe) open discussion can happen - mini support groups, or similar.  Spaces run by people who have the illnesses in question would be lovely.', 'Destigmatize it so that people don''t feel like they are othered, and so that no one acts like "no one here has mental illness/is disabled/etc".  Find plans that don''t place limits on how many times you can see a professional or what you can see a professional for (ex. autism diagnosis is covered but no follow-up therapy related to it is).  Enable spaces where (safe) open discussion can happen - mini support groups, or similar.  Spaces run by people who have the illnesses in question would be lovely.'),
