(130546, 2819, 61, 'I have a close group of coworkers who I''m more open with about why I''m missing work (feeling depressed, needing a mental health day), therapy, etc.', 'I have a close group of coworkers who I''m more open with about why I''m missing work (feeling depressed, needing a mental health day), therapy, etc.'),
(130547, 2819, 62, '1', '1'),
(130548, 2819, 63, 'I speak at conferences and meetups about self-care, so it''s natural for people to approach me with these kinds of issues. A lot of them ask me about my opinions on whether or not they are just feeling burnt out or suffering from a mental illness, at which point I direct them to a professional. Or sometimes people just want encouragement and support to take time for themselves and I''m more than happy to be their self-care cheerleader!', 'I speak at conferences and meetups about self-care, so it''s natural for people to approach me with these kinds of issues. A lot of them ask me about my opinions on whether or not they are just feeling burnt out or suffering from a mental illness, at which point I direct them to a professional. Or sometimes people just want encouragement and support to take time for themselves and I''m more than happy to be their self-care cheerleader!'),
