(130566, 2819, 81, '5', '5'),
(130567, 2819, 82, 'There was a lot of burnout and depression at one of my previous jobs and the c-level leadership completely disregarded it. They emphasized that you should be "committed to the company no matter what" and "mental health is no excuse to not come to work"', 'There was a lot of burnout and depression at one of my previous jobs and the c-level leadership completely disregarded it. They emphasized that you should be "committed to the company no matter what" and "mental health is no excuse to not come to work"'),
(130568, 2819, 83, 'Yes, I observed', 'Sí, lo observé'),
(130569, 2819, 84, '-1', NULL),
(130570, 2819, 85, '2', '2'),
(130571, 2819, 86, 'Our industry wears exhaustion like a badge of honor and encourages people to ignore their most basic needs. There''s the pressure to always be connected and it can be really toxic. Fortunately there are a few people who care and make that known, but nothing will change unless people either make it a priority when choosing employers OR those in leadership create a conversation around it. ', 'Our industry wears exhaustion like a badge of honor and encourages people to ignore their most basic needs. There''s the pressure to always be connected and it can be really toxic. Fortunately there are a few people who care and make that known, but nothing will change unless people either make it a priority when choosing employers OR those in leadership create a conversation around it.'),
(130572, 2819, 87, 'Not that I can think of!', 'Not that I can think of!'),
