(131916, 2837, 63, 'A few of my direct reports have battled with periodic depression. Most often it is described as going through a "low" that makes any form of productivity extremely difficult. My response is to take time off and look for tasks/projects that are interesting and exciting. ', 'A few of my direct reports have battled with periodic depression. Most often it is described as going through a "low" that makes any form of productivity extremely difficult. My response is to take time off and look for tasks/projects that are interesting and exciting.'),
