(131988, 2838, 59, 'My direct supervisor is also personal friend. They were very accepting of what I said and helpful in giving time off, adjusted work load, and encouragement to seek professional help.', 'My direct supervisor is also personal friend. They were very accepting of what I said and helpful in giving time off, adjusted work load, and encouragement to seek professional help.'),
