(131990, 2838, 61, 'It was nothing big or formal. But as we discussed certain projects, schedules, or tasks I would sometimes mention that it made me anxious and that I needed to have time alone to work, and not be on chat so I could hole up and focus. They were accepting.', 'It was nothing big or formal. But as we discussed certain projects, schedules, or tasks I would sometimes mention that it made me anxious and that I needed to have time alone to work, and not be on chat so I could hole up and focus. They were accepting.'),
