(133434, 2857, 61, 'I have friends here who have similar "social issues" - extreme introversion, nervousness, easily startled by unexpected noises, and we can talk about that.  There''s a high level of acceptance for a lot of things here; much more than any other place I''ve worked.  Generally if any of us admit to a weird phobia, we''ll all start discussing them openly.', 'I have friends here who have similar "social issues" - extreme introversion, nervousness, easily startled by unexpected noises, and we can talk about that.  There''s a high level of acceptance for a lot of things here; much more than any other place I''ve worked.  Generally if any of us admit to a weird phobia, we''ll all start discussing them openly.'),
(133435, 2857, 62, '1', '1'),
