(137612, 2912, 59, 'Because I have a family history of serious mental illness known to have a heritable component, I asked my manager to be alert during my performance reviews for signs of abnormal behavior. He responded that he is not a doctor and I should seek professional help if I have specific concerns, but that he would bear it in mind. No specific actions were taken.', 'Because I have a family history of serious mental illness known to have a heritable component, I asked my manager to be alert during my performance reviews for signs of abnormal behavior. He responded that he is not a doctor and I should seek professional help if I have specific concerns, but that he would bear it in mind. No specific actions were taken.'),
