(137851, 2915, 70, '1', '1'),
(137852, 2915, 71, 'I was depressed about getting on the bad side of my 2nd level manager and the more upset I was with him the more he was with me and the less work I got done. I got into trouble for being "too involved" with another company because I signed an NDA and didn''t realize I couldn''t sign it as a personal thing. Ended up crying with my direct manager. And he was trying to be helpful and figure out what to do.', 'I was depressed about getting on the bad side of my 2nd level manager and the more upset I was with him the more he was with me and the less work I got done. I got into trouble for being "too involved" with another company because I signed an NDA and didn''t realize I couldn''t sign it as a personal thing. Ended up crying with my direct manager. And he was trying to be helpful and figure out what to do.'),
(137853, 2915, 72, '1', '1'),
(137854, 2915, 73, 'They were just very supportive and helpful. They also didn''t understand why they were being so harsh on me.', 'They were just very supportive and helpful. They also didn''t understand why they were being so harsh on me.'),
