(139134, 2932, 61, 'I shared that I believe my family has an diagnosed history with bi-polar. My co-worker''s spouse has bi-polar so my co-worker was able to share some good advice and pointed out that some behavioral patterns I had noticed in family members could be related to bi-polar.

The tone of the conversation was a solemn  empathy. Overall it was supportive, however it was not a happy conversation.', 'I shared that I believe my family has an diagnosed history with bi-polar. My co-worker''s spouse has bi-polar so my co-worker was able to share some good advice and pointed out that some behavioral patterns I had noticed in family members could be related to bi-polar.

The tone of the conversation was a solemn  empathy. Overall it was supportive, however it was not a happy conversation.'),
(139135, 2932, 62, '1', '1'),
(139136, 2932, 63, 'I talked to a co-worker because I believed my family has an diagnosed history with bi-polar. My co-worker''s spouse has bi-polar and shared experiences in living and caring for someone who has bi-polar. 

Overall, it was a supportive and empathetic conversation, however it was not a happy conversation. ', 'I talked to a co-worker because I believed my family has an diagnosed history with bi-polar. My co-worker''s spouse has bi-polar and shared experiences in living and caring for someone who has bi-polar. 

Overall, it was a supportive and empathetic conversation, however it was not a happy conversation.'),
