(139310, 2934, 85, '1', '1'),
(139311, 2934, 86, 'Stop treating developers like they aren''t human beings. Stop expecting unrealistic deadlines and hound them to finish. Fear driven development leads to triggering these mental episodes. People with a disorder want and can function Ina. Work environment. But there has to be proper training and awareness for this in the workplace to be mindful. This in turn works out positively even for those without a diagnosis. the tech industry needs to treat people better period.', 'Stop treating developers like they aren''t human beings. Stop expecting unrealistic deadlines and hound them to finish. Fear driven development leads to triggering these mental episodes. People with a disorder want and can function Ina. Work environment. But there has to be proper training and awareness for this in the workplace to be mindful. This in turn works out positively even for those without a diagnosis. the tech industry needs to treat people better period.'),
