(143768, 2993, 59, 'I shared simply that I have difficulties with mood from time to time; that things are well managed in multiple ways but that sometimes I find I need additional help. That help may require me to take a day off to work with a specialist.', 'I shared simply that I have difficulties with mood from time to time; that things are well managed in multiple ways but that sometimes I find I need additional help. That help may require me to take a day off to work with a specialist.'),
