(153436, 3120, 75, 'My friend/coworker got into fully-blown psychosis in a month after taking LSD/MDMA. He slowly became more and more agitated during this time. We had chatted a lot about his mental state. I did not fully realize what''s going on until he started panicking constantly fearing for his life. He went to mental health facility next morning. It could really help if I had some knowledge about mental disorders at the time.', 'My friend/coworker got into fully-blown psychosis in a month after taking LSD/MDMA. He slowly became more and more agitated during this time. We had chatted a lot about his mental state. I did not fully realize what''s going on until he started panicking constantly fearing for his life. He went to mental health facility next morning. It could really help if I had some knowledge about mental disorders at the time.'),
