(153571, 3122, 58, '1', '1'),
(153572, 3122, 59, 'I had a candid conversation about a situation prompting me to seek medical advice, and my subsequent diagnosis of Generalised Anxiety Disorder. My line manager, and friend, was very supportive and understanding, thanking me for trusting him and my employer with the information. It was very easy for me to take some time off to adjust, and return to work. I agreed to keep my line manager apprised if I’m having an off day. I’ve been very open about my condition, and his has been reciprocated by my colleagues who are all very understanding and accommodating. ', 'I had a candid conversation about a situation prompting me to seek medical advice, and my subsequent diagnosis of Generalised Anxiety Disorder. My line manager, and friend, was very supportive and understanding, thanking me for trusting him and my employer with the information. It was very easy for me to take some time off to adjust, and return to work. I agreed to keep my line manager apprised if I’m having an off day. I’ve been very open about my condition, and his has been reciprocated by my colleagues who are all very understanding and accommodating.'),
