(153599, 3122, 86, 'I can’t only speak to my industry, so I have no idea if the tech industry is better or worse than most. But generally, I feel mental health to be very openly discussed and supported in the general community. I think it’s great that so many employers (mine included) actively help those with mental disorders. ', 'I can’t only speak to my industry, so I have no idea if the tech industry is better or worse than most. But generally, I feel mental health to be very openly discussed and supported in the general community. I think it’s great that so many employers (mine included) actively help those with mental disorders.'),
