(153751, 3124, 86, 'First off, I think it''s really hit-or-miss. Some places are probably great and everywhere else is probably terrible. I think it''s like diversity in that everyone should take a course where they find out about a bunch of the possibilities and thus give everyone a baseline. Many people have no experiences and thus just have no idea and may not have an idea they have no idea.', 'First off, I think it''s really hit-or-miss. Some places are probably great and everywhere else is probably terrible. I think it''s like diversity in that everyone should take a course where they find out about a bunch of the possibilities and thus give everyone a baseline. Many people have no experiences and thus just have no idea and may not have an idea they have no idea.'),
