(155395, 3146, 58, '1', '1'),
(155396, 3146, 59, 'When I was diagnosed with depression, I mentioned it to my manager and to a few close coworkers. Reactions were positive. I''m now preparing for a longer leave of absence to cope with burn-out and they''ve been "semi-helpful" in the sense that we don''t have a MH specific policy, but they''re doing whatever they can to make that fit within our more generic disability leave policy.', 'When I was diagnosed with depression, I mentioned it to my manager and to a few close coworkers. Reactions were positive. I''m now preparing for a longer leave of absence to cope with burn-out and they''ve been "semi-helpful" in the sense that we don''t have a MH specific policy, but they''re doing whatever they can to make that fit within our more generic disability leave policy.'),
(155397, 3146, 60, '1', '1'),
(155398, 3146, 61, 'As indicated previously — I mentioned that had been diagnosed depression and treated for it. Reactions were positive and supportive.', 'As indicated previously — I mentioned that had been diagnosed depression and treated for it. Reactions were positive and supportive.'),
(155399, 3146, 62, '1', '1'),
(155400, 3146, 63, 'A few coworkers opened up to me about their own depression or other MH issues when I mentioned mine.', 'A few coworkers opened up to me about their own depression or other MH issues when I mentioned mine.'),
