(156991, 3167, 58, '1', '1'),
(156992, 3167, 59, 'I told my employer about my trouble focusing and my diagnosis of anxiety and ADD. He was very understanding, and did not press the issue allowing me to open up as much so wanted. He really made me feel comfortable talking with him. ', 'I told my employer about my trouble focusing and my diagnosis of anxiety and ADD. He was very understanding, and did not press the issue allowing me to open up as much so wanted. He really made me feel comfortable talking with him.'),
(156993, 3167, 60, '1', '1'),
(156994, 3167, 61, 'I have talked to multiple co-workers about my struggles with anxiety and ADD. Their reactions varied from "me too" and them sharing their experiences to just general empathy. While I haven''t told all of my co-workers I don''t it''s something I feel i need to hide from them. ', 'I have talked to multiple co-workers about my struggles with anxiety and ADD. Their reactions varied from "me too" and them sharing their experiences to just general empathy. While I haven''t told all of my co-workers I don''t it''s something I feel i need to hide from them.'),
(156995, 3167, 62, '1', '1'),
(156996, 3167, 63, 'A co-worker told me about their experience with depression and how they try to cope with it. Often co-workers will post in our mental health slack room if they are having a bad day and they''ll receive support from the group.', 'A co-worker told me about their experience with depression and how they try to cope with it. Often co-workers will post in our mental health slack room if they are having a bad day and they''ll receive support from the group.'),
