(157979, 3180, 58, '1', '1'),
(157980, 3180, 59, 'My depression and anxiety make it hard for me at times to deal with certain workplace situations.  I spoke with my direct supervisor to let him know the situation I was in.  He responded positively asked how he could help.   He made it easy for me to make all appointments with my therapist whether that meant I have to arrive late or leave work early.', 'My depression and anxiety make it hard for me at times to deal with certain workplace situations.  I spoke with my direct supervisor to let him know the situation I was in.  He responded positively asked how he could help.   He made it easy for me to make all appointments with my therapist whether that meant I have to arrive late or leave work early.'),
(157981, 3180, 60, '1', '1'),
(157982, 3180, 61, 'I recognized that there was a co-worker who might have similar issues to me.  So I opened up about my issues and they shared so I could offer help.', 'I recognized that there was a co-worker who might have similar issues to me.  So I opened up about my issues and they shared so I could offer help.'),
