(158361, 3185, 60, '1', '1'),
(158362, 3185, 61, 'I''ve shared that I struggle with depression. As a manager I feel it is incumbent upon myself to set an example for my employees that it is OK / normal, in order to break the stigma.', 'I''ve shared that I struggle with depression. As a manager I feel it is incumbent upon myself to set an example for my employees that it is OK / normal, in order to break the stigma.'),
(158363, 3185, 62, '1', '1'),
(158364, 3185, 63, 'A direct report of mine has spoken to me about her mental health issues. She has not shared extensive details, but I am generally aware of when things are especially challenging for her outside of work, and am able to take that into account as it affects her work.', 'A direct report of mine has spoken to me about her mental health issues. She has not shared extensive details, but I am generally aware of when things are especially challenging for her outside of work, and am able to take that into account as it affects her work.'),
