(158386, 3185, 85, '3', '3'),
(158387, 3185, 86, 'I''m seeing a trend in the right direction of open conversation about it, but only in small pockets of the industry. It needs to be normalized more widely. The biggest challenge is the stigma. Even places that offer mental health care as a benefit don''t do a great job of communicating it because it seems to be a taboo subject.', 'I''m seeing a trend in the right direction of open conversation about it, but only in small pockets of the industry. It needs to be normalized more widely. The biggest challenge is the stigma. Even places that offer mental health care as a benefit don''t do a great job of communicating it because it seems to be a taboo subject.'),
(158388, 3185, 87, 'I had a hard time answering whether or not my mental health issues (and awareness thereof) have affected my career. I don''t really have a way to measure that or know for sure if it has.', 'I had a hard time answering whether or not my mental health issues (and awareness thereof) have affected my career. I don''t really have a way to measure that or know for sure if it has.'),
