(158742, 3190, 61, 'I talk occasionally about my direct reports about how therapy has benefited me, and how it might help them, if they bring up a mental health issue that seems like therapy could help.  A number of them went on to begin therapy, and they tell me about their progress occasionally.', 'I talk occasionally about my direct reports about how therapy has benefited me, and how it might help them, if they bring up a mental health issue that seems like therapy could help.  A number of them went on to begin therapy, and they tell me about their progress occasionally.'),
