(159815, 3204, 70, '1', '1'),
(159816, 3204, 71, 'I simply told my boss why I had been late to or missing work lately. He seemed to care and he told me to take the time I needed.', 'I simply told my boss why I had been late to or missing work lately. He seemed to care and he told me to take the time I needed.'),
(159817, 3204, 72, '1', '1'),
(159818, 3204, 73, 'I once had a panic attack and had to ask one of my female colleagues to bring my belongings to the bathroom. She seemed to understand what I was going through. Additionally, I recently told my friends who I worked with at that job about what happened that day, because they were encountering the same issues. It really helped us to reconnect and understand that that place wasn''t good for us.', 'I once had a panic attack and had to ask one of my female colleagues to bring my belongings to the bathroom. She seemed to understand what I was going through. Additionally, I recently told my friends who I worked with at that job about what happened that day, because they were encountering the same issues. It really helped us to reconnect and understand that that place wasn''t good for us.'),
(159819, 3204, 74, '1', '1'),
(159820, 3204, 75, 'When I told my friends from the job I mentioned in the previous question about the panic attack I had, they explained that they had the same issues. Additionally, another former colleague has come up in conversation because we have seen his mood decline somewhat.', 'When I told my friends from the job I mentioned in the previous question about the panic attack I had, they explained that they had the same issues. Additionally, another former colleague has come up in conversation because we have seen his mood decline somewhat.'),
