(162236, 3236, 59, 'I discussed my scheduling with my manager to account for time needed for regular mental health care appointments. My manager was very open and accommodating to the discussion and time needed out of the normal work day.', 'I discussed my scheduling with my manager to account for time needed for regular mental health care appointments. My manager was very open and accommodating to the discussion and time needed out of the normal work day.'),
