(162238, 3236, 61, 'I shared my use of mental health counseling in a context of encouraging others to talk about it and seek mental health support if needed. We also discussed how our insurance covers mental health care. Their reactions were open and interested in the conversation, and some followed up privately to ask questions later.', 'I shared my use of mental health counseling in a context of encouraging others to talk about it and seek mental health support if needed. We also discussed how our insurance covers mental health care. Their reactions were open and interested in the conversation, and some followed up privately to ask questions later.'),
