(162844, 3244, 59, 'Mostly just discussed that I had started going to therapy with my direct manager.  He was supportive.  I am allowed to take time to go to the psychologist every week.', 'Mostly just discussed that I had started going to therapy with my direct manager.  He was supportive.  I am allowed to take time to go to the psychologist every week.'),
