(162846, 3244, 61, 'Told everyone I was starting therapy in our #mental-health chat in Slack and told everyone how our insurance was covering it so they had an idea of what my experience was.', 'Told everyone I was starting therapy in our #mental-health chat in Slack and told everyone how our insurance was covering it so they had an idea of what my experience was.'),
