(163300, 3250, 59, '-1', NULL),
(163301, 3250, 60, '1', '1'),
(163302, 3250, 61, 'Our company uses a chat program called Slack where there are many channels created to discuss various topics. I am part of the mental health channel. It is a safe space to talk about how we feel and what our struggles are. A lot of love and support is shared there. It is the best experience I''ve ever had regarding mental health discussions and the workplace.', 'Our company uses a chat program called Slack where there are many channels created to discuss various topics. I am part of the mental health channel. It is a safe space to talk about how we feel and what our struggles are. A lot of love and support is shared there. It is the best experience I''ve ever had regarding mental health discussions and the workplace.'),
(163303, 3250, 62, '1', '1'),
(163304, 3250, 63, 'They talked about strategies they have when tough times occur and places at work to go if you need a break. They discussed their own diagnosis and medications.', 'They talked about strategies they have when tough times occur and places at work to go if you need a break. They discussed their own diagnosis and medications.'),
