(163603, 3254, 58, '1', '1'),
(163604, 3254, 59, 'I mentioned that I had a lot of anxiety in my life during a 1 on 1, and my manager suggested that I start seeing a therapist. During the 1 on 1, she talked about how beneficial it was for her to have a therapist, and how it might help me. She forwarded me a link to a recommended office in my neighborhood after the meeting. ', 'I mentioned that I had a lot of anxiety in my life during a 1 on 1, and my manager suggested that I start seeing a therapist. During the 1 on 1, she talked about how beneficial it was for her to have a therapist, and how it might help me. She forwarded me a link to a recommended office in my neighborhood after the meeting.'),
(163605, 3254, 60, '1', '1'),
(163606, 3254, 61, 'I''ve talked to several people on my team about mental health. One of our conversations about where we went for therapy, but a lot of others have been about acknowledging the stress and anxiety in our lives and how we handle it(or don''t).', 'I''ve talked to several people on my team about mental health. One of our conversations about where we went for therapy, but a lot of others have been about acknowledging the stress and anxiety in our lives and how we handle it(or don''t).'),
(163607, 3254, 62, '1', '1'),
(163608, 3254, 63, 'My coworker told me about some of the medication that he is on, and how his mental health has an effect on his physical health.', 'My coworker told me about some of the medication that he is on, and how his mental health has an effect on his physical health.'),
