(163630, 3254, 85, '3', '3'),
(163631, 3254, 86, 'I think we talk a big game of being supportive of mental health, but we lack the follow through. It''s great to offer PTO, but it''s not great to create an environment where you''re looked down on for taking PTO. Similarly, it''s not great to create deadlines that put unnecessary levels of stress on people, and then repeating it over and over again without allowing time for recovery. I''ve seen both of these happen.', 'I think we talk a big game of being supportive of mental health, but we lack the follow through. It''s great to offer PTO, but it''s not great to create an environment where you''re looked down on for taking PTO. Similarly, it''s not great to create deadlines that put unnecessary levels of stress on people, and then repeating it over and over again without allowing time for recovery. I''ve seen both of these happen.'),
