(173039, 3378, 70, '1', '1'),
(173040, 3378, 71, 'Most people in my previous company worked remotely, which has pros and cons for certain kinds of mental health issues.  We''d have somewhat open conversations about the fact that it was a unique issue for our company, but I don''t think any tailored program was ever created.', 'Most people in my previous company worked remotely, which has pros and cons for certain kinds of mental health issues.  We''d have somewhat open conversations about the fact that it was a unique issue for our company, but I don''t think any tailored program was ever created.'),
