(174562, 3398, 73, 'I discussed my depression briefly with an old coworker.  She listened kindly and apologized that I had to deal with that.  She was very inquisitive of what I was doing to deal with it.', 'I discussed my depression briefly with an old coworker.  She listened kindly and apologized that I had to deal with that.  She was very inquisitive of what I was doing to deal with it.'),
