(174571, 3398, 82, 'As mentioned earlier, my supervisor has Anxiety and ADHD.  She is sometimes made the butt of jokes because of this.  Older coworkers, particularly, will openly proclaim that they do not understand why she is the way she is. ', 'As mentioned earlier, my supervisor has Anxiety and ADHD.  She is sometimes made the butt of jokes because of this.  Older coworkers, particularly, will openly proclaim that they do not understand why she is the way she is.'),
