(175538, 3411, 61, 'It was a few days before World Mental Health Day, and we had just come out of a panel at a conference about mental health. I disclosed my recent diagnosis, and my manager teared up a bit. And offered to help however she could. We had a discussion about what our company could do to make sure I felt supported/was supported. It was a very positive conversation. My disorder was not disclosed to anyone else at the company.', 'It was a few days before World Mental Health Day, and we had just come out of a panel at a conference about mental health. I disclosed my recent diagnosis, and my manager teared up a bit. And offered to help however she could. We had a discussion about what our company could do to make sure I felt supported/was supported. It was a very positive conversation. My disorder was not disclosed to anyone else at the company.'),
