(175562, 3411, 85, '2', '2'),
(175563, 3411, 86, 'Prevent burnout. Seriously reprimand or give negative reputations to companies that allow burnout and have burnout as part of the culture. Burnout as part of company culture looks like working longer than 8 hours a day; having PagerDuty go off in the middle of the night for someone who isn''t on-call; not allowing employees to unplug during vacation. Ways to prevent burnout: Allow employees to unplug when not working (nights, weekend).

Never let it get to the point that an employee commits suicide due to working conditions.', 'Prevent burnout. Seriously reprimand or give negative reputations to companies that allow burnout and have burnout as part of the culture. Burnout as part of company culture looks like working longer than 8 hours a day; having PagerDuty go off in the middle of the night for someone who isn''t on-call; not allowing employees to unplug during vacation. Ways to prevent burnout: Allow employees to unplug when not working (nights, weekend).

Never let it get to the point that an employee commits suicide due to working conditions.'),
