(175763, 3414, 58, '1', '1'),
(175764, 3414, 59, 'discussed with my manager that one of my directs seemed to be struggling with mental health, they had me make a breakdown of 1. our mental health benefits and 2. covered providers within walking distance of our office and distribute it to our entire team (to make them not feel singled out) but then i was able to follow up with them in our next one on one', 'discussed with my manager that one of my directs seemed to be struggling with mental health, they had me make a breakdown of 1. our mental health benefits and 2. covered providers within walking distance of our office and distribute it to our entire team (to make them not feel singled out) but then i was able to follow up with them in our next one on one'),
