(175776, 3414, 71, 'i asked for days off to deal with anxiety and ptsd. the first time it always seemed fine but by the second time the response would usually chill.', 'i asked for days off to deal with anxiety and ptsd. the first time it always seemed fine but by the second time the response would usually chill.'),
