(175778, 3414, 73, 'I''m just very open about my mental health, and i try to discuss it openly to make others feel at ease if they want to talk about theirs.', 'I''m just very open about my mental health, and i try to discuss it openly to make others feel at ease if they want to talk about theirs.'),
