(175791, 3414, 86, 'many companies have a culture of output with little to no compassion for the mental health of their employees, which is ironic because our mental facilities are the only tool we have to create output', 'many companies have a culture of output with little to no compassion for the mental health of their employees, which is ironic because our mental facilities are the only tool we have to create output'),
