(187545, 3569, 60, '1', '1'),
(187546, 3569, 61, 'In discussing our workload, my coworker and I have talked about how we fit in to the current environment, and how stressful it feels to be left out of certain conversations, both in person and electronically. The conversation''s purpose was definitely to vent - she and I both shared similar feelings, and were able to confide in one another in a meaningful way. ', 'In discussing our workload, my coworker and I have talked about how we fit in to the current environment, and how stressful it feels to be left out of certain conversations, both in person and electronically. The conversation''s purpose was definitely to vent - she and I both shared similar feelings, and were able to confide in one another in a meaningful way.'),
