(188836, 3586, 59, 'I spoke with the head of HR regarding a mental health issue and the coverages the company provided to help me cover the costs.  She was very supportive and continues to check in on me from time to time.', 'I spoke with the head of HR regarding a mental health issue and the coverages the company provided to help me cover the costs.  She was very supportive and continues to check in on me from time to time.'),
(188837, 3586, 60, '1', '1'),
