(188839, 3586, 62, '1', '1'),
(188840, 3586, 63, 'Someone who reports to me has described depression and anxiety with me.  It has, rarely, but has affected his ability to come to work.  I shared with him my experiences in the hope that he would feel that I can empathize with him and that its a safe place to discuss it if he needs help.', 'Someone who reports to me has described depression and anxiety with me.  It has, rarely, but has affected his ability to come to work.  I shared with him my experiences in the hope that he would feel that I can empathize with him and that its a safe place to discuss it if he needs help.'),
