(190811, 3612, 58, '1', '1'),
(190812, 3612, 59, 'I am currently taking a leave of absence from work in order to address some mental health issues I''ve had. I had an event related to mental health recently, and I knew I needed to address it in a significant way right now, so I told my boss what had happened and that I need to take this time to address it. I went in the next day to stand in front of the whole company to tell them that I would be out for the month to address my mental health.', 'I am currently taking a leave of absence from work in order to address some mental health issues I''ve had. I had an event related to mental health recently, and I knew I needed to address it in a significant way right now, so I told my boss what had happened and that I need to take this time to address it. I went in the next day to stand in front of the whole company to tell them that I would be out for the month to address my mental health.'),
(190813, 3612, 60, '1', '1'),
(190814, 3612, 61, 'I''ve told a number of coworkers about my situation (described above), and everyone has reacted positively, encouraging me to do what I need to in order to get better.', 'I''ve told a number of coworkers about my situation (described above), and everyone has reacted positively, encouraging me to do what I need to in order to get better.'),
