(191434, 3620, 73, 'I worked in a mental health provider setting so I talked with a few of my close colleagues about our own mental health, including both professional issues like projection and secondary trauma, as well as individual mental health topics like stress and mental wellness practices, anger, depression (not mine, but my coworkers''). ', 'I worked in a mental health provider setting so I talked with a few of my close colleagues about our own mental health, including both professional issues like projection and secondary trauma, as well as individual mental health topics like stress and mental wellness practices, anger, depression (not mine, but my coworkers'').'),
(191435, 3620, 74, '1', '1'),
(191436, 3620, 75, 'I don''t remember exactly, but many of the people I worked with were peer mentors who worked in mental health and also lived with their own diagnoses. ', 'I don''t remember exactly, but many of the people I worked with were peer mentors who worked in mental health and also lived with their own diagnoses.'),
