(193395, 3646, 58, '1', '1'),
(193396, 3646, 59, 'I informed my direct supervisor at the time that I had diagnosed MDD/GAD and that, while it was currently well-managed, it''s possible that it would affect my work. She acknowledged what I was saying but never asked about it again. I have unlimited sick leave and they never ask questions, so it''s never been an issue since.', 'I informed my direct supervisor at the time that I had diagnosed MDD/GAD and that, while it was currently well-managed, it''s possible that it would affect my work. She acknowledged what I was saying but never asked about it again. I have unlimited sick leave and they never ask questions, so it''s never been an issue since.'),
(193397, 3646, 60, '1', '1'),
(193398, 3646, 61, 'I informed my coworkers of my existing condition and how it can affect my work, energy level, etc. but also how I have worked to address it and overcome it when it gets hard. They were supportive and several subsequently shared their own experiences with mental illness.', 'I informed my coworkers of my existing condition and how it can affect my work, energy level, etc. but also how I have worked to address it and overcome it when it gets hard. They were supportive and several subsequently shared their own experiences with mental illness.'),
