(194547, 3661, 70, '1', '1'),
(194548, 3661, 71, 'Once I quit a job because of stress and relationship strain, having that conversation was pretty easy with the manager and not so easy with the CEO. Another company, during a divorce with my first wife, I became quite depressed and it was starting to impact my performance, attendance, etc. The manager of that company sat me down and asked how he could personally help.', 'Once I quit a job because of stress and relationship strain, having that conversation was pretty easy with the manager and not so easy with the CEO. Another company, during a divorce with my first wife, I became quite depressed and it was starting to impact my performance, attendance, etc. The manager of that company sat me down and asked how he could personally help.'),
(194549, 3661, 72, '1', '1'),
(194550, 3661, 73, 'I frequently try to express my levels of stress or anxiety without being negative. Also, I''d like others to know if I''m not feeling well mentally so that we don''t run into a situation where one of us is causing a problem to the other.', 'I frequently try to express my levels of stress or anxiety without being negative. Also, I''d like others to know if I''m not feeling well mentally so that we don''t run into a situation where one of us is causing a problem to the other.'),
(194551, 3661, 74, '1', '1'),
(194552, 3661, 75, 'I''ve found out from coworkers that they struggle with depression for years while we worked together and I never knew about it. Crazy how well the tech/professional world hides this stuff.', 'I''ve found out from coworkers that they struggle with depression for years while we worked together and I never knew about it. Crazy how well the tech/professional world hides this stuff.'),
(194553, 3661, 76, '7', '7'),
(194554, 3661, 77, '5', '5'),
(194555, 3661, 78, '0', '0'),
(194556, 3661, 79, '-1', NULL),
(194557, 3661, 80, '-1', NULL),
(194558, 3661, 81, '5', '5'),
(194559, 3661, 82, '-1', NULL),
(194560, 3661, 83, 'Maybe/Not sure', 'Quizá / no estoy seguro/a'),
(194561, 3661, 84, '-1', NULL),
(194562, 3661, 85, '3', '3'),
(194563, 3661, 86, 'Be more open about it, first and foremost. The technology field is super emotionally disconnected. Which is interesting, because I imagine there''s a fair amount of autism genetics floating around in the field—which are known for less emotional response. More talks at conferences, more awareness campaigns and things of this nature will help a lot with the emotional wellness of the industry and, since the industry has such an impact on modern life, the emotional wellness of a lot of walks of life. ', 'Be more open about it, first and foremost. The technology field is super emotionally disconnected. Which is interesting, because I imagine there''s a fair amount of autism genetics floating around in the field—which are known for less emotional response. More talks at conferences, more awareness campaigns and things of this nature will help a lot with the emotional wellness of the industry and, since the industry has such an impact on modern life, the emotional wellness of a lot of walks of life.'),
(194564, 3661, 87, 'I think it may be good to speak to wellness in terms of addiction as well. I''ve known quite a few folks in the industry with addition issues—be them drugs, overworking or social media. Which is interesting because those are the people introducing addicting features of software to the rest of society.', 'I think it may be good to speak to wellness in terms of addiction as well. I''ve known quite a few folks in the industry with addition issues—be them drugs, overworking or social media. Which is interesting because those are the people introducing addicting features of software to the rest of society.'),
