(195160, 3669, 75, 'Other co-workers would talk to me about their mental health issues. I also experienced people speculating about another employee''s mental health when there were visible signs they were not doing well.', 'Other co-workers would talk to me about their mental health issues. I also experienced people speculating about another employee''s mental health when there were visible signs they were not doing well.'),
