(195324, 3671, 87, 'My dad worked as a programmer when I was very very young. When I was about 4 years old, he was diagnosed with Manic Depression and Bi-Polar disorder. His job would not tolerate it or work with him and ended up going on total social security disability and quitting his job. This put our family in deep poverty. Not sure why I''m sharing this, except that I hope others don''t have to go through the same thing.', 'My dad worked as a programmer when I was very very young. When I was about 4 years old, he was diagnosed with Manic Depression and Bi-Polar disorder. His job would not tolerate it or work with him and ended up going on total social security disability and quitting his job. This put our family in deep poverty. Not sure why I''m sharing this, except that I hope others don''t have to go through the same thing.'),
