(195993, 3680, 72, '1', '1'),
(195994, 3680, 73, 'Telling a few coworkers that I saw a therapist, both to break down stigma and to help encourage them to get some support surrounding mental health. One coworker had a lot of questions. Another said they wanted to go to therapy, but the cost was prohibitive & didn’t seem to want to look into subsidized/sliding scale options. ', 'Telling a few coworkers that I saw a therapist, both to break down stigma and to help encourage them to get some support surrounding mental health. One coworker had a lot of questions. Another said they wanted to go to therapy, but the cost was prohibitive & didn’t seem to want to look into subsidized/sliding scale options.'),
