(197520, 3700, 79, '-1', NULL),
(197521, 3700, 80, '-1', NULL),
(197522, 3700, 81, '3', '3'),
(197523, 3700, 82, 'I think people just try to use it as an excuse to gossip about other people and try to demean them. They don''t need to make allowances necessarily, but they should respect that other person regardless and understand their perspective. Often, comments about others'' mental health comes from a lack of emotion in the work place in general.', 'I think people just try to use it as an excuse to gossip about other people and try to demean them. They don''t need to make allowances necessarily, but they should respect that other person regardless and understand their perspective. Often, comments about others'' mental health comes from a lack of emotion in the work place in general.'),
(197524, 3700, 83, 'Yes, I experienced', 'Sí, lo viví'),
(197525, 3700, 84, '-1', NULL),
(197526, 3700, 85, '3', '3'),
(197527, 3700, 86, 'I''m not sure how to judge the entire industry. I feel that some companies completely ignore it from a historical lack of admitting emotions in the work environment and others allow employees to take time off, work from home, have less structured days/offices to help. It is really split high/low.', 'I''m not sure how to judge the entire industry. I feel that some companies completely ignore it from a historical lack of admitting emotions in the work environment and others allow employees to take time off, work from home, have less structured days/offices to help. It is really split high/low.'),
