(197574, 3701, 57, 'Same level of comfort for each', 'Igual de cómodo/a con ambas'),
(197575, 3701, 58, '1', '1'),
(197576, 3701, 59, 'I have been open with many people at my company, including my managers and direct reports, about having an anxiety disorder. Periodically I need to work from home or take vacation time to care for my mental health, which has been accepted without question from everyone.', 'I have been open with many people at my company, including my managers and direct reports, about having an anxiety disorder. Periodically I need to work from home or take vacation time to care for my mental health, which has been accepted without question from everyone.'),
(197577, 3701, 60, '1', '1'),
(197578, 3701, 61, 'I have told my team members when I will be out of the office or working from home due to anxiety. They were supportive and hoped I felt better.

I''ve also talked about mental health with other coworkers who suffer from mental health disorders, and had conversations about how it affects us at work and how we cope when it''s particularly bad.', 'I have told my team members when I will be out of the office or working from home due to anxiety. They were supportive and hoped I felt better.

I''ve also talked about mental health with other coworkers who suffer from mental health disorders, and had conversations about how it affects us at work and how we cope when it''s particularly bad.'),
(197579, 3701, 62, '1', '1'),
(197580, 3701, 63, 'Coworkers and I who share mental health issues (primarily anxiety and depression) have talked about how we handle our issues best while working at our company, including ways to cope during flare-ups at work.', 'Coworkers and I who share mental health issues (primarily anxiety and depression) have talked about how we handle our issues best while working at our company, including ways to cope during flare-ups at work.'),
