(197806, 3704, 61, 'I had to explain why I would not be able to go to a work event because I needed to see my psychiatrist. Anyone who has had an appointment with a psych knows that the appointments are difficult to get and expensive and therefore if you have one, you should try to make it!  They were supportive but I still felt guilty about it. ', 'I had to explain why I would not be able to go to a work event because I needed to see my psychiatrist. Anyone who has had an appointment with a psych knows that the appointments are difficult to get and expensive and therefore if you have one, you should try to make it!  They were supportive but I still felt guilty about it.'),
