(198336, 3711, 59, 'After a rather terrible situation where a manager tried to "call my bluff on my disability", I sat him down with the VP of HR and explained the ADA. By the end of the conversation i informed the company and him that they had opened themselves up to a terrible situation.', 'After a rather terrible situation where a manager tried to "call my bluff on my disability", I sat him down with the VP of HR and explained the ADA. By the end of the conversation i informed the company and him that they had opened themselves up to a terrible situation.'),
