(203427, 3778, 58, '1', '1'),
(203428, 3778, 59, 'Discussed Anxiaty disorder and how my previous job negatively effected it and my overall health/happyness. My employer was understanding of the situation. I did not request any action to be taken nor did they offer. We agreed to just be upfront and honest in our communication.', 'Discussed Anxiaty disorder and how my previous job negatively effected it and my overall health/happyness. My employer was understanding of the situation. I did not request any action to be taken nor did they offer. We agreed to just be upfront and honest in our communication.'),
(203429, 3778, 60, '1', '1'),
(203430, 3778, 61, 'I''ve only had surface level conversations, more so feeling out their situation and understanding of mental health and mental health issues.', 'I''ve only had surface level conversations, more so feeling out their situation and understanding of mental health and mental health issues.'),
