(203440, 3778, 71, 'Unfortuately I waited until I was at the breaking point and needed to quit.  My supervisor was willing to put me on Medical leave for a period of time but I declined.', 'Unfortuately I waited until I was at the breaking point and needed to quit.  My supervisor was willing to put me on Medical leave for a period of time but I declined.'),
(203441, 3778, 72, '1', '1'),
(203442, 3778, 73, 'I shared with my closes employees as sometimes my anxiaty would make me shut down and become unavailable for a day when they needed to contact me. They were supportive.', 'I shared with my closes employees as sometimes my anxiaty would make me shut down and become unavailable for a day when they needed to contact me. They were supportive.'),
