(203579, 3780, 58, '1', '1'),
(203580, 3780, 59, 'When I was diagnosed with ADHD and began treatment, I discussed it with my boss and supervisor. At first, I think they expected to me to fit into the "neuro-typical" mold after starting treatment, but that wasn''t meant to be. I sent my supervisor a variety of articles explaining ADHD and how it would affect me at work. Over a couple of years, I think they''ve accepted that I won''t be normal. There''s still an expectation that my performance is on par as my coworkers and that I won''t use my ADHD as a crutch, but I''m allowed to use coping mechanisms to help me succeed.', 'When I was diagnosed with ADHD and began treatment, I discussed it with my boss and supervisor. At first, I think they expected to me to fit into the "neuro-typical" mold after starting treatment, but that wasn''t meant to be. I sent my supervisor a variety of articles explaining ADHD and how it would affect me at work. Over a couple of years, I think they''ve accepted that I won''t be normal. There''s still an expectation that my performance is on par as my coworkers and that I won''t use my ADHD as a crutch, but I''m allowed to use coping mechanisms to help me succeed.'),
(203581, 3780, 60, '1', '1'),
(203582, 3780, 61, 'The coworkers I''ve told have been understanding. They haven''t vocalized their opinions or reactions.  I think they might have paused a moment after I explained it, but they haven''t treated me any differently.', 'The coworkers I''ve told have been understanding. They haven''t vocalized their opinions or reactions.  I think they might have paused a moment after I explained it, but they haven''t treated me any differently.'),
(203583, 3780, 62, '1', '1'),
(203584, 3780, 63, 'We both suffer from anxiety, so it was more of a conversation of us relating to each other and mental blocks we encounter because of it.', 'We both suffer from anxiety, so it was more of a conversation of us relating to each other and mental blocks we encounter because of it.'),
