(204794, 3796, 57, 'Same level of comfort for each', 'Igual de cómodo/a con ambas'),
(204795, 3796, 58, '1', '1'),
(204796, 3796, 59, 'I told my direct supervisor (the CTO) that I would be out for therapy appointments every two weeks for approximately three months. I told him so that he wouldn''t think I was interviewing. He was supportive and told me to do what I needed.', 'I told my direct supervisor (the CTO) that I would be out for therapy appointments every two weeks for approximately three months. I told him so that he wouldn''t think I was interviewing. He was supportive and told me to do what I needed.'),
(204797, 3796, 60, '1', '1'),
(204798, 3796, 61, 'I have a few friends at work to whom I''ve mentioned my depression. It was in conversational context and there was no strong reaction.', 'I have a few friends at work to whom I''ve mentioned my depression. It was in conversational context and there was no strong reaction.'),
(204799, 3796, 62, '1', '1'),
(204800, 3796, 63, 'My coworker told me about her therapy and medication. She is fairly open in talking about it in the workplace, usually as part of self-deprecating humor.', 'My coworker told me about her therapy and medication. She is fairly open in talking about it in the workplace, usually as part of self-deprecating humor.'),
(204801, 3796, 64, '10', '10'),
(204802, 3796, 65, '10', '10'),
(204803, 3796, 66, '-1', NULL),
(204804, 3796, 67, '-1', NULL),
(204805, 3796, 68, '1', '1'),
(204806, 3796, 69, 'Physical health', 'Salud física'),
(204807, 3796, 70, '1', '1'),
(204808, 3796, 71, 'After my boyfriend died, I had to discuss accommodations I would need to return to work while dealing with difficulty concentrating, flashbacks of time in the hospital, and stress level. They seemed uncomfortable but were accommodating and said I could do whatever was needed. They were very good about allowing me time off after his death, up to a point. Then hints were made that I should be returning to work (about 2 weeks after he entered the hospital, 1 week after his death). I returned to work 1 1/2 weeks after his death. I was definitely not ready, but didn''t know how to broach the topic.', 'After my boyfriend died, I had to discuss accommodations I would need to return to work while dealing with difficulty concentrating, flashbacks of time in the hospital, and stress level. They seemed uncomfortable but were accommodating and said I could do whatever was needed. They were very good about allowing me time off after his death, up to a point. Then hints were made that I should be returning to work (about 2 weeks after he entered the hospital, 1 week after his death). I returned to work 1 1/2 weeks after his death. I was definitely not ready, but didn''t know how to broach the topic.'),
(204809, 3796, 72, '1', '1'),
(204810, 3796, 73, 'With co-workers that I was friends with, I have been open about my depression. At one previous employer, we made a joke that everyone was on <company name>-meds because we all took anti-depressants. After my boyfriend died, I asked my co-workers to meet me to work at a coffee shop for a half day, so I could ease back into working. They all agreed and were very generous and accommodating.', 'With co-workers that I was friends with, I have been open about my depression. At one previous employer, we made a joke that everyone was on <company name>-meds because we all took anti-depressants. After my boyfriend died, I asked my co-workers to meet me to work at a coffee shop for a half day, so I could ease back into working. They all agreed and were very generous and accommodating.'),
(204811, 3796, 74, '1', '1'),
(204812, 3796, 75, 'Other co-workers talked about their anxiety medication and anti-depressant medication with me if we were friends.', 'Other co-workers talked about their anxiety medication and anti-depressant medication with me if we were friends.'),
(204813, 3796, 76, '8', '8'),
