(207331, 3829, 86, 'Talk about it, ever. Stop hiring and supporting abusive "geniuses". Understand concepts like the psychological contract between employees and employers. Understand and actively support diversity and inclusion efforts. Check in on your under-represented and marginalized employees. Make sure they''re making friends at work, they''re comfortable in their work space, they know who they can talk to. ', 'Talk about it, ever. Stop hiring and supporting abusive "geniuses". Understand concepts like the psychological contract between employees and employers. Understand and actively support diversity and inclusion efforts. Check in on your under-represented and marginalized employees. Make sure they''re making friends at work, they''re comfortable in their work space, they know who they can talk to.'),
