(210000, 3865, 6, 'I don''t know', 'No lo sé');

That may be through talking about it more to reduce stigma, or making mental health as commonplace as physical health. Explicit safety statements could be good, as well. 

Personally a large part of why I would hide mental health issues is shame. The stigma of the past is strong.', 'I think there''s a long way to go to make those of us who have a mental health issue feel safe to talk about it. It feel like a risk almost every time right now.

That may be through talking about it more to reduce stigma, or making mental health as commonplace as physical health. Explicit safety statements could be good, as well. 

Personally a large part of why I would hide mental health issues is shame. The stigma of the past is strong.'),
