(211408, 3883, 59, 'Simply saying that I was stressed due to other things outside of work. The conversation was very supportive, and I was told that it was okay to let certain things slip if they had to. ', 'Simply saying that I was stressed due to other things outside of work. The conversation was very supportive, and I was told that it was okay to let certain things slip if they had to.'),
