(211412, 3883, 63, 'They told me they were stressed about retirement planning. Their grandparents had all died in their early 60''s and they weren''t sure if they would be around to enjoy retirement with that looming over them, but they didn''t want to be irresponsible and not plan for retirement in case they lived a longer life.', 'They told me they were stressed about retirement planning. Their grandparents had all died in their early 60''s and they weren''t sure if they would be around to enjoy retirement with that looming over them, but they didn''t want to be irresponsible and not plan for retirement in case they lived a longer life.'),
