(212560, 3898, 71, 'As simple as it could be I was direct and, at that moment I was ok, if I was fired, and said that I needed therapy and probably treatment for my stress level. He was ok with (as even if it wasn''t ok, he didn''t have an option) and from the therapist, I was directed to a doctor and got treated. A solid great decision that helped me extremely.', 'As simple as it could be I was direct and, at that moment I was ok, if I was fired, and said that I needed therapy and probably treatment for my stress level. He was ok with (as even if it wasn''t ok, he didn''t have an option) and from the therapist, I was directed to a doctor and got treated. A solid great decision that helped me extremely.'),
(212561, 3898, 72, '1', '1'),
(212562, 3898, 73, 'They were my coworkers but they are my friends, so the talks were very productive and they were/are supportive.', 'They were my coworkers but they are my friends, so the talks were very productive and they were/are supportive.'),
