(213616, 3912, 63, 'I''ve had numerous coworkers tell me that they were not doing well either related to work stress or independent of work. In some cases, they were already seeking help and needed to vent or share. In other cases, if they were interested in feedback, I recommended talking to a therapist in addition to friends.', 'I''ve had numerous coworkers tell me that they were not doing well either related to work stress or independent of work. In some cases, they were already seeking help and needed to vent or share. In other cases, if they were interested in feedback, I recommended talking to a therapist in addition to friends.'),
