(213638, 3912, 85, '2', '2'),
(213639, 3912, 86, 'The most common, significant issue I see in technology is burnout. Working overtime is almost expected in tech. The pace of the industry and projects typically require overtime. Even when management is not advocating for overtime, it is rarely discouraged. Perhaps more could be done to help control overtime for the sake of health.', 'The most common, significant issue I see in technology is burnout. Working overtime is almost expected in tech. The pace of the industry and projects typically require overtime. Even when management is not advocating for overtime, it is rarely discouraged. Perhaps more could be done to help control overtime for the sake of health.'),
(213640, 3912, 87, 'Working in a digital field means always being connected. It means always being "on the job." In many cases, we are on-call as well. Work is constant. This carries stress.', 'Working in a digital field means always being connected. It means always being "on the job." In many cases, we are on-call as well. Work is constant. This carries stress.'),
