(221614, 4017, 81, '2', '2'),
(221615, 4017, 82, 'Colleague with paranoia not supported and the rest of us didn''t know what to do.  I know that not having a particular issue means you should do everything in your power to support people with problems but, from the experience of having a chronically depressed parent, I know that caring can absolutely take over.', 'Colleague with paranoia not supported and the rest of us didn''t know what to do.  I know that not having a particular issue means you should do everything in your power to support people with problems but, from the experience of having a chronically depressed parent, I know that caring can absolutely take over.'),
