(221974, 4022, 61, 'At my old job I told a few people, including one manager I had during my time there. They were generally supportive but it was hard for them to understand unless they had direct experience with mental illness themselves or through someone close to them.', 'At my old job I told a few people, including one manager I had during my time there. They were generally supportive but it was hard for them to understand unless they had direct experience with mental illness themselves or through someone close to them.'),
(221975, 4022, 62, '1', '1'),
(221976, 4022, 63, 'In general, these conversations were always confidential and secretive. Not out in the open.', 'In general, these conversations were always confidential and secretive. Not out in the open.'),
