(223568, 4043, 59, 'I have had to deal with my reaction to my wife''s Bipolar/Suicidal Ideation, and had to take time off due to it inflaming my Anxiety and Depression. I received wonderful support.', 'I have had to deal with my reaction to my wife''s Bipolar/Suicidal Ideation, and had to take time off due to it inflaming my Anxiety and Depression. I received wonderful support.'),
(223569, 4043, 60, '1', '1'),
(223570, 4043, 61, 'We''ve talked about our various problems, and people have been very accepting. But I am still somewhat careful. More and more as I get older I''ve stopped caring about the stigma, but I am worried about consequences. Lately, people have been very supportive.', 'We''ve talked about our various problems, and people have been very accepting. But I am still somewhat careful. More and more as I get older I''ve stopped caring about the stigma, but I am worried about consequences. Lately, people have been very supportive.'),
(223571, 4043, 62, '1', '1'),
(223572, 4043, 63, 'We had a group of friends with mental health issues that would commiserate and cover for one another.', 'We had a group of friends with mental health issues that would commiserate and cover for one another.'),
