(225490, 4068, 81, '5', '5'),
(225491, 4068, 82, 'Part of my mental health history included an anxious/depressive crash, which was handled very poorly by me, but also by some supervisors and leaders. There was a strong sense of questioning my fitness for that career, which contributed to a shift in career. The failure of leadership to provide meaningful help in that case was very distressing. ', 'Part of my mental health history included an anxious/depressive crash, which was handled very poorly by me, but also by some supervisors and leaders. There was a strong sense of questioning my fitness for that career, which contributed to a shift in career. The failure of leadership to provide meaningful help in that case was very distressing.'),
(225492, 4068, 83, 'Yes, I experienced', 'Sí, lo viví'),
(225493, 4068, 84, '-1', NULL),
(225494, 4068, 85, '3', '3'),
(225495, 4068, 86, 'More awareness, more acceptance. More understanding of how some MHIs and MHDs can be competitive advantages, and how building products that support folks with the above can ALSO be a competitive advantage. ', 'More awareness, more acceptance. More understanding of how some MHIs and MHDs can be competitive advantages, and how building products that support folks with the above can ALSO be a competitive advantage.'),
