(225924, 4074, 59, 'I was in a difficult situation where the clinic where I was being treated for my eating disorder had changed its clinical model, making me ineligible for care. 

I was dealing with a lot of stress and sat down with my boss to let him know what was going on.

He was very supportive, telling me to take the time I needed to get things sorted out, and let me cry in his office.

I felt very supported and safe.', 'I was in a difficult situation where the clinic where I was being treated for my eating disorder had changed its clinical model, making me ineligible for care. 

I was dealing with a lot of stress and sat down with my boss to let him know what was going on.

He was very supportive, telling me to take the time I needed to get things sorted out, and let me cry in his office.

