(227762, 4098, 73, 'At one company, I had a co-worker who was very open about his past experiences, so I felt comfortable sharing my own. It helps if you feel the co-worker is a friend, not just a fellow employee. Shared experiences also provide common ground.', 'At one company, I had a co-worker who was very open about his past experiences, so I felt comfortable sharing my own. It helps if you feel the co-worker is a friend, not just a fellow employee. Shared experiences also provide common ground.'),
(227763, 4098, 74, '1', '1'),
(227764, 4098, 75, 'I have a co-worker who was in an abusive relationship. He was (and is) very open about the experience, his therapy, his personal growth, and helping friends and co-workers to understand their own situations.', 'I have a co-worker who was in an abusive relationship. He was (and is) very open about the experience, his therapy, his personal growth, and helping friends and co-workers to understand their own situations.'),
(227765, 4098, 76, '7', '7'),
(227766, 4098, 77, '4', '4'),
