(229343, 4119, 58, '1', '1'),
(229344, 4119, 59, 'I''ve talked about my ADHD with two different managers. With one, it was a fantastic conversation and we restructured my job to play to my strengths. With the other, it was a horrible experience where any time something didn''t go the way that my manager wanted, he blamed it on my ADHD (even when it was completely unrelated). It got to the point where I had to quit that job and find another. ', 'I''ve talked about my ADHD with two different managers. With one, it was a fantastic conversation and we restructured my job to play to my strengths. With the other, it was a horrible experience where any time something didn''t go the way that my manager wanted, he blamed it on my ADHD (even when it was completely unrelated). It got to the point where I had to quit that job and find another.'),
(229345, 4119, 60, '1', '1'),
(229346, 4119, 61, 'I''ve talked to a number of people about my ADHD. Honestly, I''m less comfortable talking about my depression. ', 'I''ve talked to a number of people about my ADHD. Honestly, I''m less comfortable talking about my depression.'),
(229347, 4119, 62, '1', '1'),
(229348, 4119, 63, 'I''ve talked with co-workers about their own depression, ADHD, ... and usually that results in my sending them to OSMI for more resources, talking about the services available from our employer and so on. ', 'I''ve talked with co-workers about their own depression, ADHD, ... and usually that results in my sending them to OSMI for more resources, talking about the services available from our employer and so on.'),
