(231170, 4143, 61, 'I told my coworker that I was going to therapy for anxiety, and I told that same coworker my therapist had been suggestion I might have Generalized Anxiety Disorder. He was mostly supportive. He did seem surprised that I was suffering and tried to comfort me.', 'I told my coworker that I was going to therapy for anxiety, and I told that same coworker my therapist had been suggestion I might have Generalized Anxiety Disorder. He was mostly supportive. He did seem surprised that I was suffering and tried to comfort me.'),
