(235575, 4201, 58, '1', '1'),
(235576, 4201, 59, 'i have severe ADHD, and it''s important to discuss this with my direct manager.  he was very understanding and told me that if i ever needed anything that he''d be there to help.', 'i have severe ADHD, and it''s important to discuss this with my direct manager.  he was very understanding and told me that if i ever needed anything that he''d be there to help.'),
(235577, 4201, 60, '1', '1'),
(235578, 4201, 61, 'i have a pretty close relationship with some of my co-workers, and have discussed my ADHD with them.  they were supportive, and didn''t pry too deeply.', 'i have a pretty close relationship with some of my co-workers, and have discussed my ADHD with them.  they were supportive, and didn''t pry too deeply.'),
(235579, 4201, 62, '1', '1'),
(235580, 4201, 63, 'one of my reports was under a lot of stress this past year, and approached me to discuss this and his resulting poor behavior.  i told him that i''d noticed, and that he should take as much time as he needs to get himself centered.  i also voiced my support if he were to seek help (which he declined).', 'one of my reports was under a lot of stress this past year, and approached me to discuss this and his resulting poor behavior.  i told him that i''d noticed, and that he should take as much time as he needs to get himself centered.  i also voiced my support if he were to seek help (which he declined).'),
