(236882, 4218, 73, 'This was in a residential youth camp, and it was important for the folks working directly with me to know that I had an anxiety disorder that was (at the time) fairly well managed. When I told my co-facilitator about my asthma, I''d also fill them in on the basics of my anxiety, and how both of those things could affect my ability to function optimally.', 'This was in a residential youth camp, and it was important for the folks working directly with me to know that I had an anxiety disorder that was (at the time) fairly well managed. When I told my co-facilitator about my asthma, I''d also fill them in on the basics of my anxiety, and how both of those things could affect my ability to function optimally.'),
