(2444, 94, 103, 'In Russia, we have mandatory medical insurance. Every employer must pay 3.6% of every employee''s salary to the insurance fund, like a tax. Everyone gets free healthcare at public clinics and hospitals. Some types of healthcare, including mental health, are still funded from the government budget, but that doesn''t matter, it''s still FREE!
