(128034, 2786, 57, 'Physical health', 'Salud física'),
(128035, 2786, 58, '1', '1'),
(128036, 2786, 59, 'I''ve mentioned, in vague terms, that I''m having mental health issues when things have gotten particularly bad. This has been helpful in requesting more structure when I''m feeling unmoored as a result of my mental illness.', 'I''ve mentioned, in vague terms, that I''m having mental health issues when things have gotten particularly bad. This has been helpful in requesting more structure when I''m feeling unmoored as a result of my mental illness.'),
(128037, 2786, 60, '1', '1'),
(128038, 2786, 61, 'We have a support slack group for people living with mental illness, and a couple select coworkers and I hold each other accountable for self care, as we all have mental health issues that we deal with.', 'We have a support slack group for people living with mental illness, and a couple select coworkers and I hold each other accountable for self care, as we all have mental health issues that we deal with.'),
(128039, 2786, 62, '1', '1'),
(128040, 2786, 63, 'Coworkers occasionally gossip about other people''s mental health. I try not to participate in this, and am likely to cut someone off if they behave this way. As such, I''m fairly certain that some of my coworkers gossip about my mental health behind my back.', 'Coworkers occasionally gossip about other people''s mental health. I try not to participate in this, and am likely to cut someone off if they behave this way. As such, I''m fairly certain that some of my coworkers gossip about my mental health behind my back.'),
(128041, 2786, 64, '5', '5'),
(128042, 2786, 65, '4', '4'),
(128043, 2786, 66, '-1', NULL),
(128044, 2786, 67, '-1', NULL),
(128045, 2786, 68, '1', '1'),
(128046, 2786, 69, 'Physical health', 'Salud física'),
(128047, 2786, 70, '0', '0'),
(128048, 2786, 71, '-1', NULL),
(128049, 2786, 72, '1', '1'),
(128050, 2786, 73, 'I told a previous coworker who I was in a relationship with about my mental health issues. He took that opportunity to try to force me to see his therapist, and used my mental health issues as a way to isolate me from the rest of our coworkers and to attempt to control me. This is a large factor in why I left my previous job and am reluctant to discuss my mental health with current coworkers and supervisors.', 'I told a previous coworker who I was in a relationship with about my mental health issues. He took that opportunity to try to force me to see his therapist, and used my mental health issues as a way to isolate me from the rest of our coworkers and to attempt to control me. This is a large factor in why I left my previous job and am reluctant to discuss my mental health with current coworkers and supervisors.'),
(128051, 2786, 74, '1', '1'),
(128052, 2786, 75, 'Women who had strong opinions were often a source of speculation from coworkers about what might be wrong with them. These conversations were always highly stigmatized and inappropriate.', 'Women who had strong opinions were often a source of speculation from coworkers about what might be wrong with them. These conversations were always highly stigmatized and inappropriate.'),
(128053, 2786, 76, '2', '2'),
(128054, 2786, 77, '0', '0'),
(128055, 2786, 78, '1', '1'),
(128056, 2786, 79, '1', '1'),
(128057, 2786, 80, '4', '4'),
(128058, 2786, 81, '3', '3'),
(128059, 2786, 82, 'As previously mentioned, my coworker, who was more senior, used this as an opportunity to isolate me from the rest of the team, negatively impact my performance reviews, and abuse me in a relationship.', 'As previously mentioned, my coworker, who was more senior, used this as an opportunity to isolate me from the rest of the team, negatively impact my performance reviews, and abuse me in a relationship.'),
(128060, 2786, 83, 'Yes, I observed', 'Sí, lo observé'),
(128061, 2786, 84, '-1', NULL),
(128062, 2786, 85, '2', '2'),
(128063, 2786, 86, 'Talk about mental health benefits explicitly. Let employees know about ADA responsibilities of employers wrt disclosures and reasonable accommodation. Actually make those reasonable accommodations rather than looking for reasons to fire people.', 'Talk about mental health benefits explicitly. Let employees know about ADA responsibilities of employers wrt disclosures and reasonable accommodation. Actually make those reasonable accommodations rather than looking for reasons to fire people.'),
(128064, 2786, 87, 'A large barrier to mental health treatment is that insurance is rather tepid on the whole issue. Employers could do better by their employees by thoroughly investigating mental health coverage and authorization policies when putting together employer based healthcare plans.', 'A large barrier to mental health treatment is that insurance is rather tepid on the whole issue. Employers could do better by their employees by thoroughly investigating mental health coverage and authorization policies when putting together employer based healthcare plans.'),
