(129274, 2802, 81, '6', '6'),
(129275, 2802, 82, 'Not a response as such, but a previous manager made some derogatory comments about sufferers of ADHD that made me unwilling to open up to him when I was experiencing difficulties.', 'Not a response as such, but a previous manager made some derogatory comments about sufferers of ADHD that made me unwilling to open up to him when I was experiencing difficulties.'),
(129276, 2802, 83, 'Yes, I experienced', 'Sí, lo viví'),
(129277, 2802, 84, '-1', NULL),
(129278, 2802, 85, '2', '2'),
(129279, 2802, 86, 'The values of the tech industry are very much focused on day-to-day productivity, which can be very difficult for people with mental health issues. My experience has been that employers are unwilling to differentiate between the performance impacts of mental health issues and other causes of low productivity. This leads to punishment and shaming, even when the company espouses support for sufferers. I think companies could focus more on what people have to offer, helping find good fit positions, and understanding that those with mental health issues will often have a more cyclical pattern of productivity than others.', 'The values of the tech industry are very much focused on day-to-day productivity, which can be very difficult for people with mental health issues. My experience has been that employers are unwilling to differentiate between the performance impacts of mental health issues and other causes of low productivity. This leads to punishment and shaming, even when the company espouses support for sufferers. I think companies could focus more on what people have to offer, helping find good fit positions, and understanding that those with mental health issues will often have a more cyclical pattern of productivity than others.'),
