(129431, 2804, 86, 'Give managers training on how to help support people with mental health issues in the workplace. Facilities that are available for quiet time etc. Non-forced collaboration in development work as not everyone can handle the cognitive overhead of talking to someone else all day. Managers share their own struggles with the people they work with to destigmatise it.', 'Give managers training on how to help support people with mental health issues in the workplace. Facilities that are available for quiet time etc. Non-forced collaboration in development work as not everyone can handle the cognitive overhead of talking to someone else all day. Managers share their own struggles with the people they work with to destigmatise it.'),
