(129719, 2808, 70, '1', '1'),
(129720, 2808, 71, 'I discussed my clinical depression and anxiety with a manager who put a lot of pressure on me to produce. I regret sharing that information with him, as he used it as a lever against me.', 'I discussed my clinical depression and anxiety with a manager who put a lot of pressure on me to produce. I regret sharing that information with him, as he used it as a lever against me.'),
