(132900, 2850, 59, 'I had a very close relationship with my boss and we were able to discuss all sorts of mental health and related issues. He was very supportive. However, I''ve never spoken with HR or other more official people.', 'I had a very close relationship with my boss and we were able to discuss all sorts of mental health and related issues. He was very supportive. However, I''ve never spoken with HR or other more official people.'),
(132901, 2850, 60, '1', '1'),
(132902, 2850, 61, 'I am very close to people on my team and sometimes we do discuss mental health issues. From my experience they are understanding and not hostile.', 'I am very close to people on my team and sometimes we do discuss mental health issues. From my experience they are understanding and not hostile.'),
(132903, 2850, 62, '1', '1'),
(132904, 2850, 63, 'We discussed some of the difficulties we both face with day to day anxiety and depression. I felt closer to those I''ve spoken with and I felt better after talking to them.', 'We discussed some of the difficulties we both face with day to day anxiety and depression. I felt closer to those I''ve spoken with and I felt better after talking to them.'),
