(135511, 2884, 86, 'The industry should start to pay more attention to mental health problems - which is generated by the much work, overtime, and stress. One solution would be, imho, disbanding the 9am-5pm working hours and let people work when they like, or actually pay people by results instead of worked hours. Another helping factor could be to allow remote working.', 'The industry should start to pay more attention to mental health problems - which is generated by the much work, overtime, and stress. One solution would be, imho, disbanding the 9am-5pm working hours and let people work when they like, or actually pay people by results instead of worked hours. Another helping factor could be to allow remote working.'),
