(138158, 2919, 73, 'What I went through in the past and present. They were supportive and understanding.', 'What I went through in the past and present. They were supportive and understanding.'),
(138159, 2919, 74, '1', '1'),
(138160, 2919, 75, 'Before leaving a job where the boss was abusive (tried to slap me across the face because they were upset my shift was over when theirs just started), I got anxiety and depression again after not having it for years. The co-worker that replaced me after I left also got anxiety and depression due to similar reasons regarding the same boss. My co-worker accused me of not warning them about said boss when I did. I apologized anyway. I tried to be as understanding as possible. They ended up ignoring me for a few years, then unfriended me after I tried to mediate between them and a mutual friend.', 'Before leaving a job where the boss was abusive (tried to slap me across the face because they were upset my shift was over when theirs just started), I got anxiety and depression again after not having it for years. The co-worker that replaced me after I left also got anxiety and depression due to similar reasons regarding the same boss. My co-worker accused me of not warning them about said boss when I did. I apologized anyway. I tried to be as understanding as possible. They ended up ignoring me for a few years, then unfriended me after I tried to mediate between them and a mutual friend.'),
(138161, 2919, 76, '2', '2'),
(138162, 2919, 77, '0', '0'),
(138163, 2919, 78, '1', '1'),
(138164, 2919, 79, '1', '1'),
(138165, 2919, 80, '7', '7'),
(138166, 2919, 81, '10', '10'),
(138167, 2919, 82, 'In a previous job, I was fired for it. In other jobs, I left because of unsupportive and/or abusive bosses. Some past jobs were okay or it didn''t come up much or at all.', 'In a previous job, I was fired for it. In other jobs, I left because of unsupportive and/or abusive bosses. Some past jobs were okay or it didn''t come up much or at all.'),
(138168, 2919, 83, 'Yes, I experienced', 'Sí, lo viví'),
(138169, 2919, 84, '-1', NULL),
(138170, 2919, 85, '3', '3'),
(138171, 2919, 86, 'In the tech industry, clients and co-workers I told were super supportive, but I''ve heard of terrible experiences of others in the tech industry as well. It makes me think I may just be lucky or good at acquiring awesome clients.', 'In the tech industry, clients and co-workers I told were super supportive, but I''ve heard of terrible experiences of others in the tech industry as well. It makes me think I may just be lucky or good at acquiring awesome clients.'),
(138172, 2919, 87, 'I have a friend who was in the same previous industry and the tech industry who was diagnosed with the same disorders and has a strikingly similar past. They also experienced the same issues in regards to mental health in both industries. Some co-workers and bosses were understanding and some weren''t.', 'I have a friend who was in the same previous industry and the tech industry who was diagnosed with the same disorders and has a strikingly similar past. They also experienced the same issues in regards to mental health in both industries. Some co-workers and bosses were understanding and some weren''t.'),
