(138612, 2925, 71, 'In 4 instances I disclosed to my employer my mental health issues. 3 were for information purposes. 1 was defensive. One boss became uncomfortable. One was familiar with my issues. One was accepting and helpful. The defensive sharing was (I had hoped) to prevent being fired. I was told I didn''t provide the right kind of information and was still fired (for performance directly affected by my mental illness).', 'In 4 instances I disclosed to my employer my mental health issues. 3 were for information purposes. 1 was defensive. One boss became uncomfortable. One was familiar with my issues. One was accepting and helpful. The defensive sharing was (I had hoped) to prevent being fired. I was told I didn''t provide the right kind of information and was still fired (for performance directly affected by my mental illness).'),
