(144074, 2997, 61, 'As I recall, I have mentioned being easily triggered and having had suicidal thoughts for several years. They displayed compassion, but I perceived a little bit of "caution" from some when they had to interact with me.', 'As I recall, I have mentioned being easily triggered and having had suicidal thoughts for several years. They displayed compassion, but I perceived a little bit of "caution" from some when they had to interact with me.'),
