(144162, 2998, 73, 'I only felt comfortable talking to some of them after working with them for more than three years and occasionally getting together outside of work.  Even then I was very vague and chose slightly less stigmatized ways of describing my issues.', 'I only felt comfortable talking to some of them after working with them for more than three years and occasionally getting together outside of work.  Even then I was very vague and chose slightly less stigmatized ways of describing my issues.'),
