(144679, 3005, 58, '1', '1'),
(144680, 3005, 59, 'I had to take a personal day to deal with stress and grief. It wasn''t following anything in particular, so I felt a little awkward but she was very understanding and urged me to take the time I needed. ', 'I had to take a personal day to deal with stress and grief. It wasn''t following anything in particular, so I felt a little awkward but she was very understanding and urged me to take the time I needed.'),
(144681, 3005, 60, '1', '1'),
(144682, 3005, 61, 'This is hard because there are some coworkers that are VERY easy to talk to, and it''s no big deal to talk about anxiety, depression, whatever. Others are more standoffish and not as emotionally available.  I would only discuss it with them if it impacted my work, and in the context of what I was doing to get better. ', 'This is hard because there are some coworkers that are VERY easy to talk to, and it''s no big deal to talk about anxiety, depression, whatever. Others are more standoffish and not as emotionally available.  I would only discuss it with them if it impacted my work, and in the context of what I was doing to get better.'),
(144683, 3005, 62, '1', '1'),
(144684, 3005, 63, 'I have a handful of close friends at work. As creatives, I think it''s a given that we all struggle with deep insecurity and depression to some extent. As far as I''m concerned, there''s very little stigma - it''s almost a given. ', 'I have a handful of close friends at work. As creatives, I think it''s a given that we all struggle with deep insecurity and depression to some extent. As far as I''m concerned, there''s very little stigma - it''s almost a given.'),
