(145387, 3014, 82, '-1', NULL),
(145388, 3014, 83, 'Yes, I experienced', 'Sí, lo viví'),
(145389, 3014, 84, '-1', NULL),
(145390, 3014, 85, '3', '3'),
(145391, 3014, 86, 'I feel there''s not enough awareness around mental health issues in general, nor their impact on developers. In particular, anxiety and depression can lead to a spiraling situation where one does not feel capable of doing the work. Having supportive co-workers who can both pick up the slack, as well as coach you through those times, can make a huge difference to the organization as a whole. Feeling both like you belong and are accepted is a huge step for many.', 'I feel there''s not enough awareness around mental health issues in general, nor their impact on developers. In particular, anxiety and depression can lead to a spiraling situation where one does not feel capable of doing the work. Having supportive co-workers who can both pick up the slack, as well as coach you through those times, can make a huge difference to the organization as a whole. Feeling both like you belong and are accepted is a huge step for many.'),
