(145999, 3022, 86, 'A work place culture that respects personal life is most important: flexible schedules, work from home, asynchronous communication that can be silenced when off duty, …. Quiet working conditions also reduce stress. Teams that enjoy working together are good for all involved.', 'A work place culture that respects personal life is most important: flexible schedules, work from home, asynchronous communication that can be silenced when off duty, …. Quiet working conditions also reduce stress. Teams that enjoy working together are good for all involved.'),
