(149187, 3064, 82, 'I have been the employer. I’ve had a depressive employee, and I haven’t been able to effectively handle them. It’s very difficult to find a way to help them while also finding a way for them to be productive.', 'I have been the employer. I’ve had a depressive employee, and I haven’t been able to effectively handle them. It’s very difficult to find a way to help them while also finding a way for them to be productive.'),
