(149191, 3064, 86, 'I think the more open we are about mental health, the better, but I also think we need to acknowledge that poor mental health is a significant liability. Knowledge work needs people with healthy minds.', 'I think the more open we are about mental health, the better, but I also think we need to acknowledge that poor mental health is a significant liability. Knowledge work needs people with healthy minds.'),
(149192, 3064, 87, 'I am not sure if it’s just that people are more willing to talk about it, but I see more people with mental health issues as time goes on. I wonder about the causes of this.', 'I am not sure if it’s just that people are more willing to talk about it, but I see more people with mental health issues as time goes on. I wonder about the causes of this.'),
