(151167, 3090, 86, 'Stop putting an emphasis on the glory of overwork, classify mental health and physical health in the same type of leave reason. Also it''s important to have a culture where you''re not required to explain why you need leave.', 'Stop putting an emphasis on the glory of overwork, classify mental health and physical health in the same type of leave reason. Also it''s important to have a culture where you''re not required to explain why you need leave.'),
