(154712, 3137, 59, 'I told them I had ADHD, and that my productivity writing code lasts for the ~6 hours after I take my medication. We try to schedule meetings in the morning so I can take my medication afterward and get the most code out of my afternoon.', 'I told them I had ADHD, and that my productivity writing code lasts for the ~6 hours after I take my medication. We try to schedule meetings in the morning so I can take my medication afterward and get the most code out of my afternoon.'),
