(164819, 3270, 58, '1', '1'),
(164820, 3270, 59, 'I have BP II and GAD. I’ve been on medical leave twice due to mental health related issues and regularly miss work for the same reasons. So, they are in the now and work with me to accommodate my illnesses.', 'I have BP II and GAD. I’ve been on medical leave twice due to mental health related issues and regularly miss work for the same reasons. So, they are in the now and work with me to accommodate my illnesses.'),
(164821, 3270, 60, '1', '1'),
(164822, 3270, 61, 'Mostly, above had positive interactions with my coworkers. There  are only a couple of coworkers who don’t treat me the same as they used too.', 'Mostly, above had positive interactions with my coworkers. There  are only a couple of coworkers who don’t treat me the same as they used too.'),
(164823, 3270, 62, '1', '1'),
(164824, 3270, 63, 'Sometimes people play armchair psychiatrist, which I quell. Other times, people feel comfortable talking to me about their own or someone they are close to’s mental issues, because I am open about mine.', 'Sometimes people play armchair psychiatrist, which I quell. Other times, people feel comfortable talking to me about their own or someone they are close to’s mental issues, because I am open about mine.'),
