(166720, 3295, 59, 'I''ve had a couple occasions where I''ve had to bail for the day due to epic panic attacks, told my boss, and been told "ok, feel better".  I''ve felt comfortable casually making comments like "there is not enough ativan in the world right now".', 'I''ve had a couple occasions where I''ve had to bail for the day due to epic panic attacks, told my boss, and been told "ok, feel better".  I''ve felt comfortable casually making comments like "there is not enough ativan in the world right now".'),
