(166722, 3295, 61, 'Much the same as those with my boss - I am as 100% comfortable stating facts about these things as I am my epilespy or anything else.', 'Much the same as those with my boss - I am as 100% comfortable stating facts about these things as I am my epilespy or anything else.'),
(166723, 3295, 62, '1', '1'),
(166724, 3295, 63, 'I''ve had 2 coworkers privately acknowledge their depression and how it was affecting them on some given day, and their need for supports.  Many #hugops are given when that happens.', 'I''ve had 2 coworkers privately acknowledge their depression and how it was affecting them on some given day, and their need for supports.  Many #hugops are given when that happens.'),
