(166798, 3296, 61, 'I told some close coworkers about mental health problems I have, as part of conversations supporting another coworker who has similar issues. The coworkers I discussed this with were all very understanding. ', 'I told some close coworkers about mental health problems I have, as part of conversations supporting another coworker who has similar issues. The coworkers I discussed this with were all very understanding.'),
(166799, 3296, 62, '1', '1'),
(166800, 3296, 63, 'One of my coworkers has ongoing problems with anxiety and depression. It causes problems with her being able to come to work regularly and we have had several conversations trying to find ways to support her as well as let the team keep working together successfully. It’s a difficult situation with no obvious answers but we are all working together in good faith to get through it.', 'One of my coworkers has ongoing problems with anxiety and depression. It causes problems with her being able to come to work regularly and we have had several conversations trying to find ways to support her as well as let the team keep working together successfully. It’s a difficult situation with no obvious answers but we are all working together in good faith to get through it.'),
(166801, 3296, 64, '7', '7'),
(166802, 3296, 65, '6', '6'),
