(166820, 3296, 83, 'Yes, I observed', 'Sí, lo observé'),
(166821, 3296, 84, '-1', NULL),
(166822, 3296, 85, '3', '3'),
(166823, 3296, 86, 'Allow more flexible working hours. Stop focusing on working too much overtime as a proxy for productivity. Treat mental health issues as physical health issues (and handle both better!).', 'Allow more flexible working hours. Stop focusing on working too much overtime as a proxy for productivity. Treat mental health issues as physical health issues (and handle both better!).'),
(166824, 3296, 87, 'After my experience at my previous job, there’s no way I would discuss my mental health issues with HR or management at a job unless it was completely unavoidable. I have started being more open about it with colleagues because I think it’s helpful for others with mental health issues to see that they are not alone, so we can mutually support each other, but it still scares me a bit.', 'After my experience at my previous job, there’s no way I would discuss my mental health issues with HR or management at a job unless it was completely unavoidable. I have started being more open about it with colleagues because I think it’s helpful for others with mental health issues to see that they are not alone, so we can mutually support each other, but it still scares me a bit.'),
