(167707, 3308, 58, '1', '1'),
(167708, 3308, 59, 'I gave a talk (to a tech audience) about anxiety recently, and in an after-work conversation with the Sr director of my org, I brought it up. He was curious about the content of my talk, so I summarized it. We had a nice neutral conversation about techniques for relieving anxiety and promoting mindfulness.', 'I gave a talk (to a tech audience) about anxiety recently, and in an after-work conversation with the Sr director of my org, I brought it up. He was curious about the content of my talk, so I summarized it. We had a nice neutral conversation about techniques for relieving anxiety and promoting mindfulness.'),
