(174194, 3393, 85, '2', '2'),
(174195, 3393, 86, 'Employers need to be aware of mental health issues and how common they are. They also need to create an environment where those issues can be disclosed without worry of losing one''s job.', 'Employers need to be aware of mental health issues and how common they are. They also need to create an environment where those issues can be disclosed without worry of losing one''s job.'),
