(180271, 3473, 82, 'There is not really any sort of support for mental health issues at my place of employment. There is a phone number you can call if you want to talk to a third party help line and that is about it. I see people here that are clearly suffering but the prevalent attitude is that you should just suck it up and keep plodding along.', 'There is not really any sort of support for mental health issues at my place of employment. There is a phone number you can call if you want to talk to a third party help line and that is about it. I see people here that are clearly suffering but the prevalent attitude is that you should just suck it up and keep plodding along.'),
(180272, 3473, 83, 'No', 'No'),
(180273, 3473, 84, '-1', NULL),
(180274, 3473, 85, '2', '2'),
(180275, 3473, 86, 'I think the biggest step would be to recognize that demanding long hours and constantly high levels of performance from people is not sustainable. I also think more could be done to be supportive to people experiencing issues and more education in the tech industry on the significance of mental health issues would be great.', 'I think the biggest step would be to recognize that demanding long hours and constantly high levels of performance from people is not sustainable. I also think more could be done to be supportive to people experiencing issues and more education in the tech industry on the significance of mental health issues would be great.'),
