(181718, 3492, 85, '1', '1'),
(181719, 3492, 86, 'I consider myself lucky in my current job position. I co-founded the project, I have been there from the beginning. The company is still small and I am essential yet. The relationship I have with my co-workers is really close. The human side of all of us is strong. All these things make it possible to be understanding with my personal situation. If I were in another more "traditional company" is possible that they are less compassionate with me.
