(194179, 3656, 82, 'One of my similarly affected colleagues needed time off as he reached a breaking point. He was harangued for being needy and shuffled around to other groups instead of being given the time needed to heal.', 'One of my similarly affected colleagues needed time off as he reached a breaking point. He was harangued for being needy and shuffled around to other groups instead of being given the time needed to heal.'),
