(196383, 3685, 82, 'I have mentioned my depression to co-workers, and one of my colleagues said, "Suck it up, buttercup"', 'I have mentioned my depression to co-workers, and one of my colleagues said, "Suck it up, buttercup"'),
(196384, 3685, 83, 'No', 'No'),
(196385, 3685, 84, '-1', NULL),
(196386, 3685, 85, '1', '1'),
(196387, 3685, 86, 'For starters, be aware of what mental health entails/encompasses. Learn how it is that an employer can help, or support someone with mental health issues. Finally, be understanding/endorsing of "mental health days". My brain is my toolbox as a software engineer, sometimes I need a day just to polish the rust off.', 'For starters, be aware of what mental health entails/encompasses. Learn how it is that an employer can help, or support someone with mental health issues. Finally, be understanding/endorsing of "mental health days". My brain is my toolbox as a software engineer, sometimes I need a day just to polish the rust off.'),
(196388, 3685, 87, 'It might be interesting to ask, "Does your company allow for sick days to be used for ''Mental Health Days''?"', 'It might be interesting to ask, "Does your company allow for sick days to be used for ''Mental Health Days''?"'),
