(196600, 3688, 71, 'I discussed depression related to an emotionally abusive relationship. They allowed me to leave work early to make it to therapy sessions.', 'I discussed depression related to an emotionally abusive relationship. They allowed me to leave work early to make it to therapy sessions.'),
