(196611, 3688, 82, 'When I discussed my anxiety and burnout the situation was left unchanged for so long that things just got worse to the point I had to quit', 'When I discussed my anxiety and burnout the situation was left unchanged for so long that things just got worse to the point I had to quit'),
(196612, 3688, 83, 'Maybe/Not sure', 'Quizá / no estoy seguro/a'),
(196613, 3688, 84, '-1', NULL),
(196614, 3688, 85, '1', '1'),
(196615, 3688, 86, 'Tell employees what their plans cover for mental health. Cover psychotherapy session out of pocket costs when insurance does not fully cover. Getting the right therapist that’s also covered under insurance is almost impossible. Most of the times the good ones don’t accept insurance so I had to pay out of pocket, I used up most of my flexible spending account with this but if I didn’t have that I would have been in trouble.', 'Tell employees what their plans cover for mental health. Cover psychotherapy session out of pocket costs when insurance does not fully cover. Getting the right therapist that’s also covered under insurance is almost impossible. Most of the times the good ones don’t accept insurance so I had to pay out of pocket, I used up most of my flexible spending account with this but if I didn’t have that I would have been in trouble.'),
(196616, 3688, 87, 'There seems to be an epidemic of narcissistic personality disorder, not sure if that’s a Bay Area or a tech industry or a startup culture thing. But I’ve had multiple managers whose behaviors fall on the spectrum of this disorder and interfere with mental health of team members as a result of emotionally abusive behaviors such as gaslighting, triangulation, public humiliation, lack of accountability/responsibility (blaming others), silent treatment, withholding information, etc.', 'There seems to be an epidemic of narcissistic personality disorder, not sure if that’s a Bay Area or a tech industry or a startup culture thing. But I’ve had multiple managers whose behaviors fall on the spectrum of this disorder and interfere with mental health of team members as a result of emotionally abusive behaviors such as gaslighting, triangulation, public humiliation, lack of accountability/responsibility (blaming others), silent treatment, withholding information, etc.'),
