(197196, 3696, 59, 'I informed my manager that I''d need to adjust my working hours on a certain day of the week to attend a recurring therapy appointment. She was 100% supportive of the plan and my treatment.', 'I informed my manager that I''d need to adjust my working hours on a certain day of the week to attend a recurring therapy appointment. She was 100% supportive of the plan and my treatment.'),
