(197198, 3696, 61, 'We have a Slack channel dedicated to discussing and supporting others in our company with mental health issues. It''s a very positive and empathetic environment.', 'We have a Slack channel dedicated to discussing and supporting others in our company with mental health issues. It''s a very positive and empathetic environment.'),
