(197299, 3697, 86, 'Some employers are really good about letting people know about the physical health benefits they get from insurance, but they neglect the mental health benefits. At a previous job (not tech related) there were services available for mental health that I didn''t find out about until I had an anxiety attack at work. Had I known about the services that were available, I could have gotten the help I needed before my work performance was effected.', 'Some employers are really good about letting people know about the physical health benefits they get from insurance, but they neglect the mental health benefits. At a previous job (not tech related) there were services available for mental health that I didn''t find out about until I had an anxiety attack at work. Had I known about the services that were available, I could have gotten the help I needed before my work performance was effected.'),
