(198210, 3709, 85, '2', '2'),
(198211, 3709, 86, 'Encourage work / life balance. Make it clear that your employees are worth more than just what they can produce (happy teams deliver more anyways). Make people aware of options they can take if they need to lighten the load a bit (this applies even if you don''t have a mood disorder bc any engineer can suffer burnout). Training for managers about needs of employees with mental health disorders.', 'Encourage work / life balance. Make it clear that your employees are worth more than just what they can produce (happy teams deliver more anyways). Make people aware of options they can take if they need to lighten the load a bit (this applies even if you don''t have a mood disorder bc any engineer can suffer burnout). Training for managers about needs of employees with mental health disorders.'),
