(200183, 3735, 82, 'Someone with depression and anxiety got an accommodation to work at a position with fewer responsibilities, but then was treated as a very junior employee (having been the manager). He left in anger and frustration. ', 'Someone with depression and anxiety got an accommodation to work at a position with fewer responsibilities, but then was treated as a very junior employee (having been the manager). He left in anger and frustration.'),
