(201099, 3747, 86, 'In general, full-time tech company employees have good benefits (especially at big companies) and good benefits usually include mental health care (at least in Washington and California where I''ve worked). But it''s also my experience that people will speak at length about their exercise routines etc and will not be as open about self care or mental healthcare.', 'In general, full-time tech company employees have good benefits (especially at big companies) and good benefits usually include mental health care (at least in Washington and California where I''ve worked). But it''s also my experience that people will speak at length about their exercise routines etc and will not be as open about self care or mental healthcare.'),
