(201224, 3749, 59, 'I mentioned that I deal with depression and anxiety and that I hadn''t been sleeping for a month, but I was working on ways to fix it. They largely accepted this explanation, and essentially urged me to figure it out because it was affecting my performance.', 'I mentioned that I deal with depression and anxiety and that I hadn''t been sleeping for a month, but I was working on ways to fix it. They largely accepted this explanation, and essentially urged me to figure it out because it was affecting my performance.'),
