(206240, 3815, 59, 'After a particularly troubling episode (not related to my place of work but known to my colleagues), my direct supervisor at the time privately encouraged me to go see a therapist to help work through it.  He was very supportive and non-judgmental about it. I did so for a few months and it was helpful.', 'After a particularly troubling episode (not related to my place of work but known to my colleagues), my direct supervisor at the time privately encouraged me to go see a therapist to help work through it.  He was very supportive and non-judgmental about it. I did so for a few months and it was helpful.'),
