(206783, 3822, 70, '1', '1'),
(206784, 3822, 71, 'I was dealing with a poor work environment and a lot of microaggressions/overt sexism and ableism from the C level of the startup I was at. It was making my PTSD worse. I went to HR but she couldn''t do anything. She was mostly concerned I might sue over things that had happened. I ended up leaving on disability before I quit completely.', 'I was dealing with a poor work environment and a lot of microaggressions/overt sexism and ableism from the C level of the startup I was at. It was making my PTSD worse. I went to HR but she couldn''t do anything. She was mostly concerned I might sue over things that had happened. I ended up leaving on disability before I quit completely.'),
(206785, 3822, 72, '1', '1'),
(206786, 3822, 73, 'I had other coworkers with mental health issues. Sometimes it was explaining that non veterans can have PTSD. A few people knew I was going to therapy regularly.', 'I had other coworkers with mental health issues. Sometimes it was explaining that non veterans can have PTSD. A few people knew I was going to therapy regularly.'),
(206787, 3822, 74, '1', '1'),
(206788, 3822, 75, 'What had happened in the past and what kind of treatment or activities helped them manage their mental health.', 'What had happened in the past and what kind of treatment or activities helped them manage their mental health.'),
(206789, 3822, 76, '5', '5'),
