(208092, 3839, 87, 'It''s very hard to get psychiatric help. I have been on a waiting list for 3 months, and that''s only since I finally got in to see a Dr who was on his last day. That reset my position in the wait list. He couldn''t do much but say I probably have ADHD and that I should get tested for that...', 'It''s very hard to get psychiatric help. I have been on a waiting list for 3 months, and that''s only since I finally got in to see a Dr who was on his last day. That reset my position in the wait list. He couldn''t do much but say I probably have ADHD and that I should get tested for that...'),
