(208596, 3846, 59, 'I disclosed that I have generalised anxiety disorder and was medicated and saw a psychologist fortnightly. I was thanked for disclosing and told to take what time I need, but the conversation was very rushed and uncomfortable. He was obviously caught off guard. While he asks how I am, my anxiety is never brought up.', 'I disclosed that I have generalised anxiety disorder and was medicated and saw a psychologist fortnightly. I was thanked for disclosing and told to take what time I need, but the conversation was very rushed and uncomfortable. He was obviously caught off guard. While he asks how I am, my anxiety is never brought up.'),
