(212320, 3895, 59, 'I discussed with my manager that I''ve been going through a bad bout of depression, and that it''s negatively affected my work output.  They have been very understanding and have worked hard to keep me on track and give me any time off or resources I need.', 'I discussed with my manager that I''ve been going through a bad bout of depression, and that it''s negatively affected my work output.  They have been very understanding and have worked hard to keep me on track and give me any time off or resources I need.'),
