(212322, 3895, 61, 'I''ve talked to some of my closer coworkers about my depression and how it''s affecting me.  Everyone is supportive, but doesn''t really know what to do with that information in most cases.', 'I''ve talked to some of my closer coworkers about my depression and how it''s affecting me.  Everyone is supportive, but doesn''t really know what to do with that information in most cases.'),
