(218426, 3975, 85, '3', '3'),
(218427, 3975, 86, 'A lot of the emphasis on being a "coding ninja" or "unicorn" places pressure on people to always be productive, always be having good days. On top of impostor syndrome it also means there''s a lot of pressure that contributes to anxiety and similar issues.', 'A lot of the emphasis on being a "coding ninja" or "unicorn" places pressure on people to always be productive, always be having good days. On top of impostor syndrome it also means there''s a lot of pressure that contributes to anxiety and similar issues.'),
