(222151, 4024, 86, 'Break down the idea that a good/rock star developer is someone who works 80+ hours a week without complaint, without sleep, and without food. Destroy the idea that developers who don''t do all of that are expendable.', 'Break down the idea that a good/rock star developer is someone who works 80+ hours a week without complaint, without sleep, and without food. Destroy the idea that developers who don''t do all of that are expendable.'),
(222152, 4024, 87, 'In my experience, my mental health is compounded by others'' reactions to portions of my identity -- Black, Queer, and assumed to be a Woman. I often feel like I don''t have the space to discuss my mental health because I''m already a minority in so many ways. The undercurrent of needing to prove my ability "in spite" of my identity both contributes to my mental health and my inability to trust that it won''t affect my career if I talk about it. ', 'In my experience, my mental health is compounded by others'' reactions to portions of my identity -- Black, Queer, and assumed to be a Woman. I often feel like I don''t have the space to discuss my mental health because I''m already a minority in so many ways. The undercurrent of needing to prove my ability "in spite" of my identity both contributes to my mental health and my inability to trust that it won''t affect my career if I talk about it.'),
