(228888, 4113, 59, 'Discussed with my manager that the stress was not good for my mental health, and some days I need to recharge by working from home. I was emotional during this conversation but he understood. If at anytime I need a mental health day, i just let him know.', 'Discussed with my manager that the stress was not good for my mental health, and some days I need to recharge by working from home. I was emotional during this conversation but he understood. If at anytime I need a mental health day, i just let him know.'),
