(230030, 4128, 61, 'I talked (superficially) about my concerns and how I have not felt so well in recent weeks, very stressed and with many sad moments, frustrated with my professional position and financial problems. The person that I spoke, said understand me and tried to help me relax and control the situation, he told that I needed professional help.', 'I talked (superficially) about my concerns and how I have not felt so well in recent weeks, very stressed and with many sad moments, frustrated with my professional position and financial problems. The person that I spoke, said understand me and tried to help me relax and control the situation, he told that I needed professional help.'),
