(232106, 4155, 85, '1', '1'),
(232107, 4155, 86, 'I think there should be groups dedicated to supporting mental health in the workplace, like how there are groups to address diversity and inclusion. There should be sessions to inform employees of mental health issues and go over what the company offers to help with these issues. Mental health should be brought up more so it’s not so taboo.', 'I think there should be groups dedicated to supporting mental health in the workplace, like how there are groups to address diversity and inclusion. There should be sessions to inform employees of mental health issues and go over what the company offers to help with these issues. Mental health should be brought up more so it’s not so taboo.'),
(232108, 4155, 87, 'The survey asked if I had a mental health disorder which I don’t since I haven’t been diagnosed, but it should ask if I think I might have a mental health issue which is more likely.', 'The survey asked if I had a mental health disorder which I don’t since I haven’t been diagnosed, but it should ask if I think I might have a mental health issue which is more likely.'),
